# Regressions from a fresh review (rv3): a class constant or a WordPress table prefix isn't input, the Mail DSL's `from` isn't SQL,
# integer-cast ids are safe, a map's key isn't an index, an opaque pointer C hands back needs no layout, and numbers and helpers in
# html_safe strings carry no markup.
